# netsurf: the Vita frontend (frontends/vita, TARGET=vita)
# Generated 2026-09-22
#
# A NetSurf frontend for the PS Vita on libvita2d, and "vita" added to the
# valid TARGETs. The rectangle plotter reproduces the verified monkey
# plot-stream contract (patches 25-27: gradient bands, box-shadows, transform
# quads, opacity buckets) through plot_geom.c, which is proved byte-identical
# to monkey's plot.c by tools/test-vita-renderer.sh. VITA_HOST_SIM=YES builds
# the same sources for the host against tools/vita-sim (run-vita-sim.sh).
# Cross build: tools/build-vita.sh. See docs/phase-0/09-vita-frontend.md.

